"- **Shift** + **Press**: Gardar a páxina actual no historial de posicións\n"
"- **Shift** + **Home**: Activar/desactivar a wifi\n"
"- **Shift** + **Back**: Cambiar ao libro aberto anteriormente\n"
"\n"
"Cando se usa un teclado virtual:\n"
"\n"
"- **Shift** + **Right**: Mover o cursor ao carácter da dereita\n"
"- **Shift** + **Left**: Mover o cursor ao carácter da esquerda\n"
"- **Shift** + **Press**: Amosar os caracteres especiais tras as teclas do "
"teclado virtual\n"
"- **Shift** + **Home**: Activar/desactivar o teclado virtual\n"
"- **Shift** + **Del**: Eliminar palabra\n"
"- **Shift** + **Back**: Eliminar toda a liña\n"
"- **Sym** + **Alphabet keys**: Símbolos, números e caracteres especiais\n"

#: frontend/ui/quickstart.lua:316
msgid ""
"## Frontlight/backlight <a id=\"flight\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"You can control your screen light via this menu. If you have warm lighting "
"(normal white LEDs+orange ones) you can control them separately from this "
"dialog:\n"
"\n"
"> **TOP MENU ➔ ![Settings](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.settings.svg) ➔ "
"Frontlight**\n"
msgstr ""
"## Luz frontal/retroiluminación <a id=\"flight\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"Podes controlar a luz da pantalla dende este menú. Se tes luz cálida (LED "
"brancos normais e LED laranxas), podes controlalos por separado dende este "
"diálogo:\n"
"\n"
"> **MENÚ SUPERIOR ➔ ![Axustes](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.settings.svg) "
"➔ Luz frontal**\n"

#: frontend/ui/quickstart.lua:326
msgid ""
"## While reading <a id=\"reading\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"table\"><div>\n"
"\n"
"You can change the font\n"
"\n"
"**TOP MENU ➔ ![Typesettings](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.typeset.svg) ➔ "
"Font**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Make font bigger\n"
"\n"
"**BOTTOM MENU ➔ ![Textsize](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.textsize.svg)**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Make font bolder\n"
"\n"
"**BOTTOM MENU ➔ ![Contrast](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.contrast.svg)**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Invert the colors (white text on black)\n"
"\n"
"**TOP MENU ➔ ![Settings](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.settings.svg) ➔ "
"Night mode**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Change many formatting options\n"
"\n"
"**TOP MENU ➔ ![Typesettings](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.typeset.svg) ➔ "
"Style tweaks**\n"
"\n"
"</div></div>\n"
msgstr ""
"## Durante a lectura <a id=\"reading\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"<div class=\"table\"><div>\n"
"\n"
"Podes cambiar a fonte\n"
"\n"
"**MENÚ SUPERIOR ➔ ![Typesettings](resources/icons/mdlight/"
"appbar.typeset.svg) ➔ Fonte**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Facer a fonte máis grande\n"
"\n"
"**MENÚ INFERIOR ➔ ![Textsize](resources/icons/mdlight/"
"appbar.textsize.svg)**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Facer a fonte máis grosa\n"
"\n"
"**MENÚ INFERIOR ➔ ![Contrast](resources/icons/mdlight/"
"appbar.contrast.svg)**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Inverter as cores (texto branco en fondo negro)\n"
"\n"
"**MENÚ SUPERIOR ➔ ![Settings](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.settings.svg) ➔ "
"Modo nocturno**\n"
"\n"
"</div><div>\n"
"\n"
"Cambiar moitas opcións de formato\n"
"\n"
"**MENÚ SUPERIOR ➔ ![Typesettings](resources/icons/mdlight/"
"appbar.typeset.svg) ➔ Axustes de estilo**\n"
"\n"
"</div></div>\n"

#: frontend/ui/quickstart.lua:363
msgid ""
"## Installing dictionaries <a id=\"dicts\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"KOReader supports dictionary lookup in EPUB and even in scanned PDF/DJVU "
"documents. To see the dictionary definition or translation, tap and hold a "
"word.\n"
"\n"
"To use the dictionary lookup function, first you need to install one or more "
"dictionaries in the StarDict format. KOReader has an inbuilt dictionary "
"installation system:\n"
"\n"
"**TOP MENU ➔ ![Search](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.search.svg) ➔ "
"Dictionary Settings > Download dictionaries**\n"
msgstr ""
"## Instalación de dicionarios <a id=\"dicts\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"KOReader permite buscar no dicionario en EPUB e mesmo en documentos PDF/DJVU "
"escaneados. Para ver a definición ou a tradución, mantén pulsada unha "
"palabra.\n"
"\n"
"Para usar a busca no dicionario, primeiro tes que instalar un ou máis "
"dicionarios no formato StarDict. KOReader inclúe un sistema de instalación "
"de dicionarios:\n"
"\n"
"**MENÚ SUPERIOR ➔ ![Busca](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.search.svg) ➔ "
"Axustes dos dicionarios > Descargar dicionarios**\n"

#: frontend/ui/quickstart.lua:374
msgid ""
"## More info <a id=\"more\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"You can find any option within the top menu using:\n"
"\n"
"**Menu ➔ ![Menu](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.menu.svg) ➔ Help ➔ Menu "
"search\n"
"\n"
"You can find more information on our GitHub page\n"
"\n"
"[https://github.com/koreader/koreader](https://github.com/koreader/"
"koreader)\n"
"\n"
"You can find other KOReader users on MobileRead forums\n"
"\n"
"[https://www.mobileread.com/forums/forumdisplay.php?f=276](https://"
"www.mobileread.com/forums/forumdisplay.php?f=276)\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"<div class=\"generated\">Generated by KOReader %1.</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"## Máis información <a id=\"more\"></a>\n"
"\n"
"Podes atopar calquera opción do menú superior deste xeito:\n"
"\n"
"**Menú ➔ ![Menu](resources/icons/mdlight/appbar.menu.svg) ➔ Axuda ➔ Busca no "
"menú\n"
"\n"
"Podes atopar máis información na nosa páxina en GitHub\n"
