"directory.\n"
"Once extraction has started, you can abort at any moment by tapping on the "
"screen.\n"
"\n"
"Cover images will be saved with the adequate size for the current display "
"mode.\n"
"If you later change display mode, they may need to be extracted again.\n"
"\n"
"This extraction may take time and use some battery power: you may wish to "
"keep your device plugged in."
msgstr ""
"Isto extraerá os metadatos e as portadas para os libros no cartafol actual.\n"
"Unha vez comezada a extracción, podes abortala en calquera momento pulsando "
"na pantalla.\n"
"\n"
"As portadas gardaranse no tamaño axeitado para o modo de presentación "
"actual.\n"
"Se máis adiante cambias de modo de presentación, pode que haxa que extraelas "
"de novo.\n"
"\n"
"Esta extracción pode levar tempo e consumir batería: quizais prefiras manter "
"o dispositivo conectado á corrente."

